<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Integon cut by Alex. Brown.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Integon cut by Alex. Brown.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it lowered its rating on Integon Corp to neutral from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Analyst not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Company reported fourth quarter operating loss of $1.14 a share compared with First Call consensus estimate of a $0.39 a share profit.</p>
<p>-- Stock closed Wednesday at 17-1/2 and was delayed at the market opening.</p>
</text>
